qcom-sensing-hub (2.3.2-1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  [ Venkata Akhil Segu ]
  * New upstream release 2.3.2
  * core: add QMI/GLink/rpmsg session communication layer
  * sensors: add sensorsdaemon (sensors.qti) systemd service
  * config: add sensors config registry subsystem
  * config: add registry configs for kalama, qrb5165, qrbx210 platforms
  * apis: add sns_device_context.proto, sns_human_presence_detect.proto,
    sns_ontable_detect.proto, sns_presence.proto; update existing protos
  * build: fix installed header paths for nanopb/proto
  * d/control: rename packages to libsensinghub1, libsensinghub-dev,
    sensinghub-session-client; add new sensinghub-sensors-daemon package;
    add Breaks/Replaces on qcom-sensing-hub and qcom-sensing-hub-dev
    for backward compatibility; add libfastrpc-dev and
    libqmi-framework-dev to Build-Depends-Arch; add libfastrpc1 dlopen dep
  * d/control: update Maintainer, Standards-Version to 4.7.4,
    Homepage/Vcs-* to github.com; add extended package descriptions
  * d/rules: add hardening=+all; reformat configure flags to multi-line
  * d/source/options: add extend-diff-ignore for upstream-only files

